Direct runtime updater notarization rejection
Date: 2026-10-29

Apple notarization rejected the uninstalled build-117 updater candidate. Submission
0a1cc7fe-9076-4ab1-8ce9-9203cfbaeaaa reported an invalid signature for the
AccountAccess executable inside the sparse `TargetImage/owner.app` bundle.
Independent `codesign --verify --strict` confirmed that the changed executable
was present but several sealed app resources were absent from the sparse image.

The candidate was not stapled, presented for installation, or installed. No
installed files, account data, or services were changed. The updater must carry
the full pinned, signed owner.app bundle for signature verification while its
apply plan remains limited to the pinned changed nodes.
